IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cpp-core`
IMPORT `cr1-related-provisions`

-- Tests of cr1-related-provisions.l4 (C.R.C.-c.-385.txt lines 1158 to 1162). Expected values are written from the
-- text: "after October 1997" starts on 1 November 1997, and "after 2015" on 1 January 2016.

§ `Tests of the Related Provisions`

#ASSERT `Related provision SOR/97-472, s 4 — the first day to which the Regulations apply` EQUALS (YMD 1997 11 1)
#ASSERT `Related provision SOR/97-472, s 4 — the Regulations apply to the amount or contribution` (YMD 1997 11 1)
#ASSERT `Related provision SOR/97-472, s 4 — the Regulations apply to the amount or contribution` (YMD 2026 3 15)
#ASSERT NOT (`Related provision SOR/97-472, s 4 — the Regulations apply to the amount or contribution` (YMD 1997 10 31))
#ASSERT NOT (`Related provision SOR/97-472, s 4 — the Regulations apply to the amount or contribution` (YMD 1997 10 1))
#ASSERT `Related provision 2015, c. 36, s 27(3) — the first day to which subsections (1) and (2) apply` EQUALS (YMD 2016 1 1)
#ASSERT `Related provision 2015, c. 36, s 27(3) — subsections (1) and (2) apply to the amount or contribution` (YMD 2016 1 1)
#ASSERT `Related provision 2015, c. 36, s 27(3) — subsections (1) and (2) apply to the amount or contribution` (YMD 2026 3 15)
#ASSERT NOT (`Related provision 2015, c. 36, s 27(3) — subsections (1) and (2) apply to the amount or contribution` (YMD 2015 12 31))
